I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` would need filesystem access, and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would need an HTTP client. Neither is granted, so the world imports neither. If operations needs them, the graph would have to grant those capabilities to this node.

